---
// A relative, zero-delay redirect: Astro.redirect() in static output emits an absolute URL built
// from `site` with a 2-second delay, which sent local previews to the live site.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Germán Bustamante</title>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/en/" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={new URL("/en/", Astro.site)} />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a href="/en/">Continue to germanbustamante.github.io/en/</a>
  </body>
</html>
